OL,3,CEbola outbreak in DR Congo outpacing
OL,4,Cefforts to fight it, WHO head warns
OL,6,FThe Ebola outbreak in the Democratic
OL,7,FRepublic of Congo is spreading faster
OL,8,Fthan efforts to fight it, the head of
OL,9,Fthe World Health Organisation has
OL,10,Fwarned.
OL,12,FNearly three months into the outbreak,
OL,13,Fnew cases are doubling in some hot
OL,14,Fspots, Tedros Adhanom Ghebreyesus said
OL,15,Fin a post on X.
OL,17,FIt comes as some health workers in the
OL,18,FDR Congo are striking over a lack of
OL,19,Fpay.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/9
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
