OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F306A1786018700
OL,3,CEbola outbreak in DR Congo outpacing
OL,4,Cefforts to fight it, WHO head warns
OL,6,FThe outbreak has accounted for 3,874
OL,7,Fconfirmed cases, including 1,751
OL,8,Fdeaths, according to the latest data
OL,9,Ffrom DR Congo's Ministry of Health.
OL,11,FOn Wednesday, Ghebreyesus met with
OL,12,Fofficials in the DR Congo's capital,
OL,13,FKinshasa. It was his second visit
OL,14,Fsince the outbreak was declared in May.
OL,16,FIn Ituri province, the epicentre of
OL,17,Fthe outbreak, families said many
OL,18,Ffrontline workers have gone on strike,
OL,19,Fworsening access to healthcare that
OL,20,Fwas already challenged by rebel
OL,21,Fconflict in a remote area.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/9
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,307,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30603
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F306A1786018700
OL,3,CEbola outbreak in DR Congo outpacing
OL,4,Cefforts to fight it, WHO head warns
OL,6,FWhile some workers say they have
OL,7,Fstarted receiving payment in the last
OL,8,Fweek for work done since the outbreak
OL,9,Fbegan, they are demanding improved
OL,10,Fwages.
OL,12,FAnicet Baluku, a resident of Bunia,
OL,13,Fthe capital of Ituri, blamed the death
OL,14,Fof his two brothers from Ebola on the
OL,15,Fstrike.
OL,17,F"We urge the authorities to quickly
OL,18,Ffind a solution to prevent other
OL,19,Ffamilies from experiencing the same
OL,20,Ftragedy," he said.
OL,26,@yD@AOU|D@IO]
