OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F306A1786018700
OL,3,CEbola outbreak in DR Congo outpacing
OL,4,Cefforts to fight it, WHO head warns
OL,6,FThe US Department of State said that
OL,7,Fit will provide an additional $242
OL,8,Fmillion (around #180 million) in
OL,9,Ffunding for immediate Ebola response
OL,10,Fand preparedness efforts in the region
OL,11,Fand for humanitarian assistance
OL,12,Frelated to the outbreak.
OL,14,FSuch funding, it said in a statement,
OL,15,Fhas now exceeded $512 million (around
OL,16,F#380 million) in direct assistance.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/9
