OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F306A1786018700
OL,3,CEbola outbreak in DR Congo outpacing
OL,4,Cefforts to fight it, WHO head warns
OL,6,FThe outbreak has eclipsed all previous
OL,7,FEbola outbreaks in its speed of
OL,8,Ftransmission and is the second-largest
OL,9,Foutbreak on record, behind the
OL,10,Foutbreak in West Africa in 2014 to
OL,11,F2016 that recorded more than 28,000
OL,12,Fcases, including over 11,000 deaths.
OL,14,FThe Bundibugyo virus that is causing
OL,15,Fthis outbreak has no approved
OL,16,Ftreatment or vaccine, and local
OL,17,Fofficials believe it began in a remote
OL,18,Farea long before it was declared on
OL,19,FMay 15.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/9
