OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F306A1786018700
OL,3,CEbola outbreak in DR Congo outpacing
OL,4,Cefforts to fight it, WHO head warns
OL,6,FThe outbreak is still "spreading at an
OL,7,Falarming and unprecedented rate," the
OL,8,Fmedical charity Doctors Without
OL,9,FBorders said on Wednesday.
OL,11,F"The response is expanding but is
OL,12,Fstill not reaching communities quickly
OL,13,Fenough to break transmission chains,"
OL,14,Fit added.
