OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F306A1786018700
OL,3,CEbola outbreak in DR Congo outpacing
OL,4,Cefforts to fight it, WHO head warns
OL,6,FDr Jean Kaseya, head of the Africa
OL,7,FCentres for Disease and Control, said
OL,8,Fon Tuesday during a visit to Bunia
OL,9,Fthat contact tracing isn't working,
OL,10,Fwith at least 60% to 70% of new cases
OL,11,Fcoming outside of those being
OL,12,Fmonitored after exposure to patients.
OL,14,FLate detection of cases has been a key
OL,15,Fcontributor to the 45% fatality rate,
OL,16,Fofficials say.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G7/9
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
