PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F306A1786018700
OL,3,CEbola outbreak in DR Congo outpacing
OL,4,Cefforts to fight it, WHO head warns
OL,6,FOf the 77 most-recent cases reported
OL,7,Fduring a 24-hour period, 44 were
OL,8,Ffatal, according to the health
OL,9,Fministry. At least 717 patients are in
OL,10,Fisolation while 749 patients have
OL,11,Frecovered.
OL,13,FKaseya, who met with Tedros on
OL,14,FWednesday, said Africa CDC is aligning
OL,15,Fits efforts with responders "around
OL,16,Fearlier detection, stronger contact
OL,17,Ftracing, rapid access to quality care
OL,18,Fand deeper engagement with
OL,19,Fcommunities."
OL,26,@wD@]OU{D@MO]
