PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F306A1786018700
OL,3,CEbola outbreak in DR Congo outpacing
OL,4,Cefforts to fight it, WHO head warns
OL,6,FTedros called for action to reach all
OL,7,Faffected localities, strengthen
OL,8,Fcoordination under the government's
OL,9,Fleadership and protect health workers.
OL,11,F"Above all, communities must be at the
OL,12,Fcenter of and have ownership of the
OL,13,Fresponse," he said. "We cannot stop
OL,14,FEbola without their trust, leadership
OL,15,Fand partnership."
